On this week's episode of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/the-macrumors-show/">The MacRumors Show</a>, we answer your listener questions about the future of Apple's product lineup, the software and services shaping the ecosystem, and our own personal histories with the company and its devices.<br/>
<br/>
